      </div>
      <p class="border-t border-(--cream)/15 px-5 py-6 text-center text-sm text-(--cream)/55">Sol y Sal is a fictional restaurant designed for Thecore's 100 Days of Web (Day 021). Reviews and publications are demo content.</p>
    </footer>
  </div>
</Landing>

